 - Holding: Candidate 1's extra stock equals the second day of each 2-day cycle. That is about 385 for item 1 plus about 168 for item 0, roughly 553 in total.\n  - Net: Candidate 1 is about 20 better.\n\n**How each plan fares when demand varies:**\n- The early item-1 shortage on days 1–4 (about 100 units) is the same in every plan. Nothing can arrive before day 5.\n- Candidate 1 covers two days per order, so one day's spike can be absorbed by the next day's dip. It also orders a little less above forecast (about 8% for item 1, against 10% for Candidate 2), so its leftover stock builds up more slowly and costs less to hold.\n- Candidate 2 buys a bit more insurance against shortages but pays for it in holding. Given how close the totals are, this slightly favours Candidate 1."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3843, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3843}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-26T08:56:51.511Z", "request_id": "req_011CgQZxZ8yD4Z4CnU7MnvtW"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01SvUeUNrTj3WvuaQt2jLXk3", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgQZxZQLUC6djeGkDZBGz", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01SvUeUNrTj3WvuaQt2jLXk3", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"choice": 1}, "caller": {"type":